*** Settings ***
Library    ExampleLibrary.py

*** Variables ***
${VALID_USER}      admin
${INVALID_USER}    hacker

*** Machine ***
${USERNAME}    any of    ${VALID_USER}    ${INVALID_USER}
${PASSWORD}    any of    correct_pass     wrong_pass

# Basic implication rule: valid user implies correct password needed
${USERNAME} == ${VALID_USER}  ==>  ${PASSWORD} == correct_pass

Start
    Log    Starting login process
  [Actions]
    attempt_login    ==>    Success    when    ${USERNAME} == ${VALID_USER}
    attempt_login    ==>    Failed     otherwise

Success
    Log    Login successful for user: ${USERNAME}
  [Actions]
    logout    ==>    Start

Failed
    Log    Login failed for user: ${USERNAME}
  [Actions]
    retry     ==>    Start

*** Keywords ***
Attempt Login
    Log    Attempting login with username: ${USERNAME} and password: ${PASSWORD}

Logout
    Log    User ${USERNAME} logged out

Retry
    Log    Retrying login
